00:02:32,289 --> 00:02:34,709
UI debugging, and for your day-to-day troubleshooting.

57
00:02:34,709 --> 00:02:36,380
This is incredibly useful.

58
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:38,960
The second major highlight of this update is 'Goal Mode'.

59
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,860
It's no longer an experimental feature.

60
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:44,140
And it is now available in the Codex app and the IDE extension.

61
00:02:44,140 --> 00:02:47,060
