66
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:57,460
Now, that sounds kind of wild.

67
00:02:57,460 --> 00:03:01,090
And to be honest, I still think this is something people need to test carefully in real workflows.

68
00:03:01,090 --> 00:03:03,530
Because long-running agents can be amazing,

69
