78
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:26,400
That's a whole different ball game from a normal chat.

79
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,880
This makes Codex feel less like a one-shot assistant,

80
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:32,320
