86
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:46,850
Then, in version 0.13102,

87
00:03:46,850 --> 00:03:48,970
In version 0.132, OpenAI also fixed goal continuations, so they stop

88
00:03:48,970 --> 00:03:53,920
to stop when they hit usage limits or repeated blockers instead of looping.

89
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:56,200
and wasting more tokens. That last part is important.

90
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:59,720
Because if an agent is going to run for hours, or even days, it needs to know

91
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:01,360
