92
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:03,140
It shouldn't just keep running because it's stuck.

93
00:04:03,140 --> 00:04:08,240
and just keep burning through context and tokens because it's stuck. So, the official launch of Goal Mode is far more than just a random toggle.

