00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:11,360
OpenAI is clearly building the infrastructure around it.

95
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:14,320
This includes things like progress storage and tracking, as well as better handling of pauses.

96
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:16,339
Better management of usage limits, and deeper integration across apps, CLI, and IDEs.

97
00:04:16,339 --> 00:04:20,290
as well as deeper integration across apps, CLI, and IDEs.

98
00:04:20,290 --> 00:04:21,029
In the long run,

99
00:04:21,029 --> 00:04:23,100
This might just be one of the most important features for Codex.

100
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:25,500
Even if it's not the flashiest one today,

101
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:28,460
But the next major update is remote computer use.

102
00:04:28,460 --> 00:04:29,540
Even when your Mac is locked,

103
00:04:29,540 --> 00:04:31,270
